xemu (0~git20260129.40dfef0d-1foundry3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Rename x-emulators -> xemu. Upstream's own build/deb-build-simple.sh has
    emitted "Package: xemu" since 2016, so the name belongs to this project;
    the unrelated original-Xbox emulator of the same name is renamed to
    xemu-xbox in the same release. This also removes a live collision: that
    upstream script's .deb and our old xemu (Xbox) shared a dpkg identity
    while being unrelated software, and its cdate version (20260129235930)
    outranks 0.8.136, so a user building it would have silently replaced the
    Xbox emulator.
  * No transitional package and no Breaks/Replaces: there are no existing
    consumers, and the old artifacts are dropped from the repository rather
    than superseded.
  * Generate .desktop entries from upstream's own build/xemu.desktop template
    and the PRG_TARGET / EMU_DESCRIPTION fields in targets/*/Makefile, instead
    of shipping seven hand-written files. Upstream ships 15 targets and the
    default build produces 7, so static files silently miss any target added
    later; the hand-written machine names had also already drifted from
    upstream's ("Commodore LCD (prototype)" vs "Commodore LCD", "Enterprise
    64/128" vs "Enterprise 128").
  * Also ship the icon at the legacy /usr/share/pixmaps path that upstream's
    template points Icon= at, alongside the hicolor one.

 -- Foundry Linux <packages@foundrylinux.org>  Wed, 05 Aug 2026 20:00:00 +0700

x-emulators (0~git20260129.40dfef0d-1foundry2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add .desktop entries for all seven emulators so they appear in
    application menus (Categories=Game;Emulator;), and vendor upstream's
    single generic 48x48 XPM icon (build/xemu-48x48.xpm) to
    /usr/share/icons/hicolor/48x48/apps/x-emulators.xpm. Upstream ships no
    per-machine artwork, so all seven entries share the one icon, matching
    upstream's own xemu.desktop template (%machine/%binary substitution) —
    ours are static per-binary files under debian/ instead.

 -- Foundry Linux <packages@foundrylinux.org>  Wed, 05 Aug 2026 14:40:00 +0700

x-emulators (0~git20260129.40dfef0d-1foundry1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Packages LGB's Xemu ("X-Emulators") suite from
    https://github.com/lgblgblgb/xemu at master commit 40dfef0d (upstream
    publishes no tags or releases, hence the git-snapshot version).
  * Ships seven emulators: xc65, xmega65, xclcd, xvic20, xep128, xprimo,
    xtvc. No ROMs are bundled.
  * Named x-emulators, not xemu: the name "xemu" is already taken in this
    repo by the unrelated original Xbox emulator (https://xemu.app). This
    follows the same precedent as asar -> asar-snes-assembler.
  * Hardening flags are appended to the generated build config rather than
    passed on the make command line, which would clobber upstream's CFLAGS.

 -- Foundry Linux <packages@foundrylinux.org>  Wed, 05 Aug 2026 09:00:00 +0700
